{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on the Ritual Altar inside the Life Cathedral with no memory or strength. How long has it been? Who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/8b394c0bfcb01a4c13c0d035e711ed2f.poster.avif?t=1756170471\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/8b394c0bfcb01a4c13c0d035e711ed2f.webm?t=1756170471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/8b394c0bfcb01a4c13c0d035e711ed2f.mp4?t=1756170471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Life Blood is a first-person, Kingsfield-like action &amp; adventure game, with a focus on exploration of a layered and interconnected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/84d4f03212e895e7b5a31543cf7cfd35.avif?t=1756170471\" width=800 height=225 /></span>A tense but rewarding combat system that requires quick reflexes and careful reading of enemy animations and use of the game's mechanics. Weapons become tools as different battles will require different strategies and weapon types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/8e8a451846cd2f1ba56715640d7df0d4.avif?t=1756170471\" width=800 height=225 /></span>Find shortcuts, unlock doors, and activate elevators that aid your route across the world. Checkpoints are few and far between, making your journeys deliberate and requiring consideration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/1615fed4653be191171dda3f5bf35341.avif?t=1756170471\" width=800 height=225 /></span>  Hidden paths might reveal an entirely new, secret location, and secret chests might house that single item you need to push forward.  Valuable items are abundant but require a keen eye to find. Don't be afraid to use the tools provided; certain battles may require a more experimental approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/fda44dd292644e229c052818dcff69ab.avif?t=1756170471\" width=800 height=225 /></span>Lore is tucked into every page of Life Blood. Item descriptions are cryptic but rich with clues. Characters you meet talk of the history of God's Reach... the secrets of the past are still waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/48070924b14abc6c08a0ec253204432e.poster.avif?t=1756170471\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/48070924b14abc6c08a0ec253204432e.webm?t=1756170471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/48070924b14abc6c08a0ec253204432e.mp4?t=1756170471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Venture down into the mountainous kingdom, loot dismal villages on the cliffside, navigate through spiralling stone dungeons and crypts, accumulate enough of the writhing Life Blood, and unseal the long-lost secrets hidden deep within the rock heart of the mountain.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2629670?t=1756170471","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756170471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/624b50a5773c30366025955011161a1fb009a42b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756170471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/624b50a5773c30366025955011161a1fb009a42b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756170471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on the Ritual Altar inside the Life Cathedral with no memory or strength. How long has it been? Who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/8b394c0bfcb01a4c13c0d035e711ed2f.poster.avif?t=1756170471\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/8b394c0bfcb01a4c13c0d035e711ed2f.webm?t=1756170471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/8b394c0bfcb01a4c13c0d035e711ed2f.mp4?t=1756170471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Life Blood is a first-person, Kingsfield-like action &amp; adventure game, with a focus on exploration of a layered and interconnected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 